          "A written cryptography policy listing approved algorithms is common but rarely enforced in code; reviewers cannot see whether developers follow it.",
          "No statute requires a crypto policy document; PCI DSS Req 12.3.3 requires a cryptographic cipher suite and protocol inventory where card data is in scope.",
          "Questionnaires ask for a cryptographic standard or policy.",
